Dear fellow TraMineR users,

I am looking for a way to compute the statistical significance for transition probabilities between two states as derived by the seqtrate() function. Bakeman and Gottman (1997, p. 108ff) provide guidance and formulas for doing this wth z-values based on an expected transition probabilities that are based on the base-frequencies of the states. I just wanted to check if someone has already implemented this before I start writing my own code for doing that?

